<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Hardened runtime with no exceptions. Shelf is not sandboxed (a simulated ⌘V
  needs Accessibility, which the sandbox forbids), so it needs no sandbox or
  network client entitlements. Library
  validation stays on: com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation is absent.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
